cff-version: 1.2.0
title: solvers
message: >-
  If you use this library of integration methods, or a tableau taken from it,
  please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rother
    given-names: Milan
    website: https://milanrother.com
repository-code: https://github.com/milanofthe/solvers
url: https://solvers.milanrother.com
abstract: >-
  A library of ordinary differential equation integration methods held as data
  rather than as code. Each method is a JSON file carrying its coefficients and
  the publication it appeared in; its order, stage order, stability, damping,
  nonlinear stability and cost are derived from those coefficients rather than
  declared, and are checked against what the file claims. The whole library is
  available as JSON at https://solvers.milanrother.com/api/methods.json
keywords:
  - ordinary differential equations
  - numerical integration
  - Runge-Kutta
  - Rosenbrock
  - linear multistep
  - Butcher tableau
  - stability region
license: MIT
